0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537" :answer-field/choices "1a7d2026-21a1-52ec-9b49-5220db72316a"] [:db/add "0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537" :answer-field/choices "6e9d6bf9-ce93-5519-891b-3931898ec663"] [:db/add "0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537" :answer-field/choices "14265516-ae65-532c-a184-fefd886b2e37"] [:db/add "0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537" :answer-field/choices "5bc45f87-f239-562e-bfa0-5cddadaefef6"] [:db/add "0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537" :answer-field/choices "0d992567-a619-5037-8f15-12c042da49ad"] [:db/add "0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537" :answer-field/correct "14265516-ae65-532c-a184-fefd886b2e37"] [:db/ensure "0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b" :question/id #uuid "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b"] [:db/add "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 3=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b" :question/answer-fields "0773353a-1ec6-50c4-977d-1ad00bcff537"] [:db/ensure "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "b1ca9dbc-ef6c-5002-b937-e30b39dc0a9b"] [:db/add "51e8012a-cb17-5de6-bb38-9993fe24bb83" :answer/id #uuid "51e8012a-cb17-5de6-bb38-9993fe24bb83"] [:db/add "51e8012a-cb17-5de6-bb38-9993fe24bb83" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "51e8012a-cb17-5de6-bb38-9993fe24bb83" :answer/value "4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "51e8012a-cb17-5de6-bb38-9993fe24bb83" :answer/validate] [:db/add "48199f27-9acc-5101-a844-84b9b9ec7b0f" :answer/id #uuid "48199f27-9acc-5101-a844-84b9b9ec7b0f"] [:db/add "48199f27-9acc-5101-a844-84b9b9ec7b0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "48199f27-9acc-5101-a844-84b9b9ec7b0f" :answer/value "8\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "48199f27-9acc-5101-a844-84b9b9ec7b0f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3e2e1306-8611-5f36-bc4d-5c4b599691be" :answer/id #uuid "3e2e1306-8611-5f36-bc4d-5c4b599691be"] [:db/add "3e2e1306-8611-5f36-bc4d-5c4b599691be" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3e2e1306-8611-5f36-bc4d-5c4b599691be" :answer/value "-4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "3e2e1306-8611-5f36-bc4d-5c4b599691be" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ef95243-03d7-5f9b-9964-050a81aafe47" :answer/id #uuid "0ef95243-03d7-5f9b-9964-050a81aafe47"] [:db/add "0ef95243-03d7-5f9b-9964-050a81aafe47" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0ef95243-03d7-5f9b-9964-050a81aafe47" :answer/value "4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "0ef95243-03d7-5f9b-9964-050a81aafe47" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1cb92fee-7ade-511f-a001-e6edbcd1480c" :answer/id #uuid "1cb92fee-7ade-511f-a001-e6edbcd1480c"] [:db/add "1cb92fee-7ade-511f-a001-e6edbcd1480c" 