3}\\cdot 3=4$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b7986f5c-b477-564a-b6a1-e6bc8f022405" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b7986f5c-b477-564a-b6a1-e6bc8f022405" :question/answer-fields "908f8536-5dab-5a3b-a7e7-013a3e062230"] [:db/ensure "b7986f5c-b477-564a-b6a1-e6bc8f022405" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "b7986f5c-b477-564a-b6a1-e6bc8f022405"] [:db/add "15788a7e-1a95-512a-95b5-65815c014108" :answer/id #uuid "15788a7e-1a95-512a-95b5-65815c014108"] [:db/add "15788a7e-1a95-512a-95b5-65815c014108" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "15788a7e-1a95-512a-95b5-65815c014108" :answer/value "4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "15788a7e-1a95-512a-95b5-65815c014108" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2cafee82-dcfb-58cf-9c2d-bdfde9adaead" :answer/id #uuid "2cafee82-dcfb-58cf-9c2d-bdfde9adaead"] [:db/add "2cafee82-dcfb-58cf-9c2d-bdfde9adaead" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2cafee82-dcfb-58cf-9c2d-bdfde9adaead" :answer/value "-2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "2cafee82-dcfb-58cf-9c2d-bdfde9adaead" :answer/validate] [:db/add "108bf616-e497-5cfe-a43c-39590412ca4c" :answer/id #uuid "108bf616-e497-5cfe-a43c-39590412ca4c"] [:db/add "108bf616-e497-5cfe-a43c-39590412ca4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "108bf616-e497-5cfe-a43c-39590412ca4c" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "108bf616-e497-5cfe-a43c-39590412ca4c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b1dc3a1c-fff6-5f5