se $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "84707fca-407c-5ae0-9f6b-a8be35d06a68" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "84707fca-407c-5ae0-9f6b-a8be35d06a68" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "84707fca-407c-5ae0-9f6b-a8be35d06a68" :question/answer-fields "2deeb12d-6b8f-5d0a-add4-d355a28f68ed"] [:db/ensure "84707fca-407c-5ae0-9f6b-a8be35d06a68" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "84707fca-407c-5ae0-9f6b-a8be35d06a68"] [:db/add "7d67f4c6-5423-5e9b-8bd3-0c8f76153ac7" :answer/id #uuid "7d67f4c6-5423-5e9b-8bd3-0c8f76153ac7"] [:db/add "7d67f4c6-5423-5e9b-8bd3-0c8f76153ac7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7d67f4c6-5423-5e9b-8bd3-0c8f76153ac7" :answer/value "6\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "7d67f4c6-5423-5e9b-8bd3-0c8f76153ac7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5927bcef-6929-518c-b557-26b60938610f" :answer/id #uuid "5927bcef-6929-518c-b557-26b60938610f"] [:db/add "5927bcef-6929-518c-b557-26b60938610f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5927bcef-6929-518c-b557-26b60938610f" :answer/value "-3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\rig