4$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "6580d3c9-1b2c-5dd3-9425-0ec2eeba4c53" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6580d3c9-1b2c-5dd3-9425-0ec2eeba4c53" :question/answer-fields "5df6d80a-9145-5b45-b0f6-b11cab1a6229"] [:db/ensure "6580d3c9-1b2c-5dd3-9425-0ec2eeba4c53" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "6580d3c9-1b2c-5dd3-9425-0ec2eeba4c53"] [:db/add "4c457006-6a85-5708-acba-32926a552ee4" :answer/id #uuid "4c457006-6a85-5708-acba-32926a552ee4"] [:db/add "4c457006-6a85-5708-acba-32926a552ee4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4c457006-6a85-5708-acba-32926a552ee4" :answer/value "3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "4c457006-6a85-5708-acba-32926a552ee4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "48aafd2f-c91d-50f0-a7cf-e73bec3c18ba" :answer/id #uuid "48aafd2f-c91d-50f0-a7cf-e73bec3c18ba"] [:db/add "48aafd2f-c91d-50f0-a7cf-e73bec3c18ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "48aafd2f-c91d-50f0-a7cf-e73bec3c18ba" :answer/value "3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "48aafd2f-c91d-50f0-a7cf-e73bec3c18ba" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d9e542fd-6abe-5edb-bcd7-fa02034ff443" :answer/id #uuid "d9e542fd-6abe-5edb-bcd7-fa02034ff443"] [:db/add "d9e542fd-6abe-5edb-bcd7-fa02034ff443" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d9e542fd-6abe-5edb-bcd7-fa02034ff443" :answer/value "6\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "d9e542fd-6abe-5edb-bcd7-fa02034ff443" :answer/validate] [:db/add "55dcf395-29a4-573b-921e-896c6c6467b0" :an