\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "f2c2956c-0c43-5953-a81f-5536789cc765" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 4=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f2c2956c-0c43-5953-a81f-5536789cc765" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f2c2956c-0c43-5953-a81f-5536789cc765" :question/answer-fields "eb52a120-a923-5ff4-ad82-6db06b46316d"] [:db/ensure "f2c2956c-0c43-5953-a81f-5536789cc765" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "f2c2956c-0c43-5953-a81f-5536789cc765"] [:db/add "2340bfbd-6513-5e5a-b825-ea1d0a903a8f" :answer/id #uuid "2340bfbd-6513-5e5a-b825-ea1d0a903a8f"] [:db/add "2340bfbd-6513-5e5a-b825-ea1d0a903a8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2340bfbd-6513-5e5a-b825-ea1d0a903a8f" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "2340bfbd-6513-5e5a-b825-ea1d0a903a8f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "da0a0217-3467-50ce-8d39-f984c8c3c4ea" :answer/id #uuid "da0a0217-3467-50ce-8d39-f984c8c3c4ea"] [:db/add "da0a0217-3467-50ce-8d39-f984c8c3c4ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "da0a0217-3467-50ce-8d39-f984c8c3c4ea" :answer/value "2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\ri