/add "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/choices "ea9ec55f-b898-5c90-bac0-6ffe3c9144b0"] [:db/add "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/choices "08b72347-1d8d-50a3-bb44-5acc1af00891"] [:db/add "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/choices "2dbcb0f3-a228-5d97-abb5-a77410bb0322"] [:db/add "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/choices "a56b2967-5d58-588f-8aa2-576b19eb8329"] [:db/add "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/choices "f90e2aa8-2afe-56fc-9184-76c2d0bf9936"] [:db/add "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/correct "ea9ec55f-b898-5c90-bac0-6ffe3c9144b0"] [:db/ensure "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db" :question/id #uuid "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db"] [:db/add "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{2 x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{2}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}=5\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{2 x}{5})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{5}\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db" :question/answer-fields "b5f52558-6f4e-5657-8e84-5a29f96489e9"] [:db/ensure "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "52f1aee4-b8af-504c-92b3-9b4debebc7db"] [:db/add "e79c0c7a-5a34-5d70-8576-7d4bdc57b10f" :answer/id #uuid "e79c0c7a-5a34-5d70-8576-7d4bdc57b10f"] [:db/add "e79c0c7a-5a34-5d70-8576-7d4bdc57b10f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e79c0c7a-5a34-5d70-8576-7d4bdc57b10f" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "e79c0c7a-5a34-5d70-8576-7d4bdc57b10f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1acdab75-b682-5d89-ba17-ef276f394c2f" :answer/id #uuid "1acdab75-b682-5d89-ba17-ef276f394c2f"] [:db/add "1acdab75-b682-5d89-ba17-ef276f394c2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1acdab75-b682-5d89-ba17-ef276f394c2f" :answer/value "-1\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "1acdab75-b682-5d89-ba17-ef276f394c2f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "828afea6-4215-56e4-94ab-9886a6888c55" :answer/id #uuid "828afea6-4215-56e4-94ab-9886a6888c55"] [:db/add "828afea6-4215-56e4-94ab-9886a6888c55" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "828afea6-4215-56e4-94ab-9886a6888c55" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "828afea6-4215-56e4-94ab-9886a6888c55" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2f6f1436-fadd-5101-aa8b-be44f17bc594" :answer/id #uuid "2f6f1436-fadd-5101-aa8b-be44f17bc594"] [:db/add "2f6f1436-fadd-5101-aa8b-be44f17bc594" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2f6f1436-fadd-5101-aa8b-be44f17bc594" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{8 x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "2f6f1436-fadd-5101-aa8b-be44f17bc594" :answer/validate] [:db/add "403d2dc3-963b-5194-a2fb-f787dfc3d9fc" :answer/id #uuid "403d2dc3-963b-5194-a2fb-f787dfc3d9fc"] [:db/add "403d2dc3-963b-5194-a2fb-f787dfc3d9fc" :answer/type :an