tor is $\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "95398754-8d8a-50d4-bfa4-4cf30d049a32" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "95398754-8d8a-50d4-bfa4-4cf30d049a32" :question/answer-fields "615685fd-3c77-5732-ab7a-0dd80584e0da"] [:db/ensure "95398754-8d8a-50d4-bfa4-4cf30d049a32" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "95398754-8d8a-50d4-bfa4-4cf30d049a32"] [:db/add "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558" :answer/id #uuid "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558"] [:db/add "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558" :answer/validate] [:db/add "885e4496-b864-582d-8ccb-3dac8e719b70" :answer/id #uuid "885e4496-b864-582d-8ccb-3dac8e719b70"] [:db/add "885e4496-b864-582d-8ccb-3dac8e719b70" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "885e4496-b864-582d-8ccb-3dac8e719b70" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "885e4496-b864-582d-8ccb-3dac8e719b70" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bd8af89a-b0b5-5864-a25f-58ec78587fb0" :answer/id #uuid "bd8af89a-b0b5-5864-a25f-58ec78587fb0"] [:db/add "bd8af89a-b0b5-5864-a25f-58ec78587fb0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bd8af89a-b0b5-5864-a25f-58ec78587fb0" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "bd8af89a-b0b5-5864-a25f-58ec78587fb0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9f99ecbe-eb5c-5e2d-be3e-2096e603573e" :answer/id #uuid "9f99ecbe-eb5c-5e2d-be3e-2096e603573e"] [:db/add "9f99ecbe-eb5c-5e2d-be3e-2096e603573e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9f99ecbe-eb5c-5e2d-be3e-2096e603573e" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "9f99ecbe-eb5c-5e2d-be3e-2096e603573e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ec9975a3-6238-5b85-a2d3-e2d78704d3ea" :answer/id #uuid "ec9975a3-6238-5b85-a2d3-e2d78704d3ea"] [:db/add "ec9975a3-6238-5b85-a2d3-e2d78704d3ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ec9975a3-6238-5b85-a2d3-e2d78704d3ea" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "ec9975a3-6238-5b85-a2d3-e2d78704d3ea" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8"] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/choices "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558"] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/choices "885e4496-b864-582d-8ccb-3dac8e719b70"] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/choices "bd8af89a-b0b5-5864-a25f-58ec78587fb0"] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/choices "9f99ecbe-eb5c-5e2d-be3e-2096e603573e"] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/choices "ec9975a3-6238-5b85-a2d3-e2d78704d3ea"] [:db/add "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/correct "fd6c2c84-bed1-5d08-abac-17fbbc982558"] [:db/ensure "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186" :question/id #uuid "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186"] [:db/add "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{3 x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186" :question/answer-fields "f3758b5c-f69f-5418-a0e7-81bbe4217ac8"] [:db/ensure "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "fc157b00-d7e7-54d0-826d-effc6b6af186"] [:db/add "b526d407-065c-533d-93e3-9ea5f1332b0e" :answer/id #uuid "b526d407-065c-533d-93e3-9ea5f1332b0e"] [:db/add "b526d407-065c-533d-93e3-9ea5f1332b0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b526d407-065c-533d-93e3-9ea5f1332b0e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "b526d407-065c-533d-93e3-9ea5f1332b0e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c3001b48-6ddc-521b-af95-0c903c6503e9" :answer/id #uuid "c3001b48-6ddc-521b-af95-0c903c6503e9"] [:db/add "c3001b48-6ddc-521b-af95-0c903c6503e9" :answer/type