 the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "c14b75ae-9ec7-5de3-b766-eb57dc73f8cc" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(2 x)^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{1}{4}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c14b75ae-9ec7-5de3-b766-eb57dc73f8cc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c14b75ae-9ec7-5de3-b766-eb57dc73f8cc" :question/answer-fields "b2441de9-3ddd-5f87-b0b9-544a72b51646"] [:db/ensure "c14b75ae-9ec7-5de3-b766-eb57dc73f8cc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "c14b75ae-9ec7-5de3-b766-eb57dc73f8cc"] [:db/add "ca5b2f59-a145-587b-a4c1-a9609a57f58b" :answer/id #uuid "ca5b2f59-a145-587b-a4c1-a9609a57f58b"] [:db/add "ca5b2f59-a145-587b-a4c1-a9609a57f58b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ca5b2f59-a145-587b-a4c1-a9609a57f58b" :answer/value "3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "ca5b2f59-a145-587b-a4c1-a9609a57f58b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "18c0ccdc-170c-54ad-a845-5dc98b396090" :answer/id #uuid "18c0ccdc-170c-54ad-a845-5dc98b396090"] [:db/add "18c0ccdc-170c-54ad-a845-5dc98b396090" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "18c0ccdc-170c-54ad-a845-5dc98b396090" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "18c0ccdc-170